  "construction": "Plain fold of a pair-partition CPM CSS code of arXiv:2609.30069 with J = 3, L = 8, P = 13. Parent qubit q = t*L + b. Parent X row (i,t) meets ((t - E[i][b]) mod P)*L + b for each block b. The involution is pi(t,b) = ((t - B[sigma[b]]) mod P, sigma[b]). Each folded qubit pairs a representative from the instance file's fold_representatives with its partner. Each parent X row becomes one generator, X on representatives and Z on partners. E = [[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [0, 6, 2, 8, 11, 1, 7, 10], [0, 11, 6, 4, 12, 8, 9, 5]], sigma = [5, 7, 4, 6, 2, 0, 3, 1], B = [2, 1, 12, 11, 1, 11, 2, 12].",
